{"content":[{"c":["TERAH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Father of Abram (Abraham), Nahor, and Haran (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.11.26","r":"Gen.11.26","rawR":"Gen.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.11.26","value":"Gen.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 11:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.26","r":"1Chr.1.26","rawR":"1Chr.1.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.26","value":"1Chr.1.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.3.34","r":"Luke.3.34","rawR":"Luke.3.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.3.34","value":"Luke.3.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 3:34"},"). Though Abram is listed first among his sons, it is likely that Abram was not the oldest. After Terah lived 70 years, he fathered Abram, Nahor, and Haran (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.11.26","r":"Gen.11.26","rawR":"Gen.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.11.26","value":"Gen.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 11:26"},"). Stephen reports in the NT, however, that Abram left Haran after the death of his father, at which time Abram was 75 years old (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.12.4","r":"Gen.12.4","rawR":"Gen.12.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.12.4","value":"Gen.12.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 12:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.7.4","r":"Acts.7.4","rawR":"Acts.7.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.7.4","value":"Acts.7.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 7:4"},"). Terah died at the age of 205 (v ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.11.32","r":"Gen.11.32","rawR":"Gen.11.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.11.32","value":"Gen.11.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 11:32"},"), which suggests that Terah was at least 130 when Abram was born. Terah initiated the trip to Canaan, though he failed to go beyond Haran (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.11.31-32","r":"Gen.11.31-32","rawR":"Gen.11.31-32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.11.31-32","value":"Gen.11.31-32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 11:31-32"},"). Abram was commanded there to leave his family and proceed to Canaan (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.12.1","r":"Gen.12.1","rawR":"Gen.12.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.12.1","value":"Gen.12.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Abraham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Abraham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Abraham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Abraham"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"TerahPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.11.26","rawQueryValue":"Gen.11.26","sourceRefExact":"Gen.11.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.26"},{"anchorText":"Lk 3:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.3.34","rawQueryValue":"Luke.3.34","sourceRefExact":"Luke.3.34"},{"anchorText":"Gn 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.11.26","rawQueryValue":"Gen.11.26","sourceRefExact":"Gen.11.26"},{"anchorText":"Gn 12:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.12.4","rawQueryValue":"Gen.12.4","sourceRefExact":"Gen.12.4"},{"anchorText":"Acts 7:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.7.4","rawQueryValue":"Acts.7.4","sourceRefExact":"Acts.7.4"},{"anchorText":"Gn 11:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.11.32","rawQueryValue":"Gen.11.32","sourceRefExact":"Gen.11.32"},{"anchorText":"Gn 11:31-32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.11.31-32","rawQueryValue":"Gen.11.31-32","sourceRefExact":"Gen.11.31-32"},{"anchorText":"12:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.12.1","rawQueryValue":"Gen.12.1","sourceRefExact":"Gen.12.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"b368d524ff1d6d527c377526fb79011ffe796121ca51a89f486d5234224d4e88","sourceItemName":"TerahPerson","sourceItemOrder":101,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"TerahPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Terah (Person)","title":"Terah (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}